---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import StartupRegistration from '@components/StartupRegistration.astro';
import '@styles/resources.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Free LaborGenie License: Staff Training & Onboarding" description="Register your email and practice name for a free LaborGenie license through PPS. Plan staff onboarding, training, and compliance preparation.">
<div class="resource-site"><div class="rs-wrap">
 <section class="rs-hero"><div class="rs-breadcrumb"><a href="/resources/">Free resources</a><span>/</span><span>LaborGenie</span></div><span class="rs-tag">Free license offer from PPS</span><h1 class="rs-title" style="margin-top:20px">Get your team ready for opening day.</h1><p class="rs-intro">Bring staff training, compliance preparation, and onboarding into your launch plan with LaborGenie. Register your email and practice name for the free license offer through PPS.</p></section>
 <div class="rs-library rs-benefits"><article class="rs-resource"><span class="rs-tag">Staff training</span><h2>Prepare your team.</h2><p>Make role-appropriate training part of your launch, including HIPAA coursework and a record of completion.</p></article><article class="rs-resource"><span class="rs-tag">Compliance preparation</span><h2>Build it into the routine.</h2><p>Connect training with the policies, responsibilities, and review steps your practice needs.</p></article><article class="rs-resource"><span class="rs-tag">Onboarding</span><h2>Start people well.</h2><p>Plan the orientation, training, and practice-specific steps new staff need before they begin work.</p></article></div>
 <StartupRegistration standalone />
 <section class="rs-section"><div class="rs-support"><div><h2>What happens after you register?</h2><p>PPS receives your request and emails you with access details. Our team arranges the license and confirms what it includes; access is not activated automatically.</p><p>Choosing product updates is optional. You can request the free license without joining the marketing list.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="rs-panel" style="margin-bottom:40px"><h2>One part of getting your practice ready.</h2><p>LaborGenie supports training, onboarding, and compliance preparation. A training certificate records course completion; it is not government certification and does not, by itself, establish that a practice meets HIPAA requirements.</p><p style="margin-top:12px">Your practice also needs appropriate policies, safeguards, and role-specific procedures. <a class="rs-link" href="https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/for-professionals/security/laws-regulations/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read HHS guidance on the HIPAA Security Rule</a>.</p><div class="rs-actions"><a class="rs-btn secondary" href="/resources/startup-checklist/">Build my startup checklist</a><a class="rs-btn secondary" href="/resources/pro-forma/">Build my pro forma</a></div></section>
</div></div>
</BaseLayout>
